+Strict source provenance covers every Git submodule compiled into the product,
+not only the NVIDIA lowering stack. Configure- and build-time guards require
+exact clean gitlinks for TensorIR, CUDA Tile, LLVM, msgpack-c, libbacktrace and
+the PyPTO runtime headers; tracked, untracked and ignored changes all fail
+closed. The clean parent PyPTO revision therefore binds the complete compiler
+source closure represented by those gitlinks.
+
